# brainiphy: generated output, do not version
# Every connector under connectors/ is scaffolded output — this repo ships the
# sample registry.yaml and nothing else. A `brain new` run pointed at this
# folder while testing would otherwise leave a connector here, with a local
# path baked into it, staged for commit.
connectors/*/
mirrors/
raw/
graphify-out/
